WEBVTT

trailer-cue-01
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:03.500
An answer needs context.

trailer-cue-02
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Ask what supports it.

trailer-cue-03
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:11.000
Start with the source.

trailer-cue-04
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.300
Snapshots and recovery.

trailer-cue-05
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:17.000
Still needs qualification.

trailer-cue-06
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:21.500
Abbey, Aviva, ABI: three profiles.

trailer-cue-07
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:25.900
Local routing includes explicit selection.

trailer-cue-08
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:29.300
Strict checks recompute hashes.

trailer-cue-09
00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:32.000
Hash links are not signatures.

trailer-cue-10
00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:35.300
An audit of thirteen patterns.

trailer-cue-11
00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:38.000
Not semantic detection.

trailer-cue-12
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:43.000
Review what each check covers.

trailer-cue-13
00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:47.000
A distributed fabric is our vision.

trailer-cue-14
00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:51.000
Hardware support requires its own evidence.

trailer-cue-15
00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:55.000
Roadmap. No delivery guarantee.

trailer-cue-16
00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:58.100
Bring a scoped project.

trailer-cue-17
00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:01.600
Let’s review the evidence.
